# Aider: which files the AI sees (the repo map, /add). Gitignore syntax.
# This is an asset library: the AI works from CATALOGUE.md and the packs' README/credits files,
# not the ~16,000 asset files. Open any asset with /read-only PATH (images work with vision models).
*
!*.md
!/tools/**
!/.aiderignore
!/.aider.conf.yml
